[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847342729","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2847342729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2847342729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ptwCJ","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T14:25:58Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T14:26:39Z","body":"A current work around for now until I hunt this further. \n@hex010 \n```\nfunc _ready():\n\tprint(\"Starting script...\")\n\tvar device_unique_id = OS.get_unique_id()\n\tprint(\"Device Unique ID: \", device_unique_id)\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(0.1).timeout\n\tprint(\"Checkpoint 1\")\n\tprint(\"Checkpoint 2\")\n\tprint(\"HELLO\")\n```\n\nGodot Engine v4.5.dev.custom_build.32eafc18b (2025-04-30 14:18:46 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\nOpenGL API 3.3.0 NVIDIA 560.94 - Compatibility - Using Device: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti\n\nStarting script...\nDevice Unique ID: {31f37ca4-d489-11ef-8824-806e6f6e6963}\nCheckpoint 1\nCheckpoint 2\nHELLO\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847342729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847607281","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2847607281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2847607281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6puwnx","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T16:14:08Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T16:14:08Z","body":"Not sure if its relevant ... but I'm digging in here. editor_log.cpp\n`if (unlikely(log->is_updating())) {\n    // The new message arrived during log RTL text processing/redraw (invalid BiDi control characters / font error), ignore it to avoid RTL data corruption.\n    return;\n}`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847607281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847636008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2847636008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2847636008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pu3oo","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T16:29:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T16:29:55Z","body":"Ok this might be as designed?\n\n```\nfunc _ready():\n\tprint(\"Starting script...\")\n\tvar device_unique_id = OS.get_unique_id()\n\tprint_rich(device_unique_id)\n\t#print(\"Device Unique ID: \", device_unique_id)\n\t#await get_tree().create_timer(0.1).timeout\n\tprint(\"Checkpoint 1\")\n\tprint(\"Checkpoint 2\")\n\tprint(\"HELLO\")\n```\nThe reason it works in console.exe is because that executable properly sets up console output handling and flushes buffers. \nprint_rich() appears to have different buffering behavior. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3026d4ca-deb6-46d5-9c7b-d32d1c167059)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847636008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847646280","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2847646280","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2847646280,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pu6JI","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T16:35:07Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T17:04:54Z","body":"```\nif (_flush_stdout_on_print) {\n    // Don't always flush when printing stdout to avoid performance\n    // issues when `print()` is spammed in release builds.\n    fflush(stdout);\n}\n```\nSo rather than being a bug, this is an intentional performance optimization to prevent excessive flushing when print is called frequently. The print_rich() function works differently because it's primarily intended for the editor's output panel and has different buffering behavior.\n\n@AThousandShips \n\nI do however see this in other areas of code \n```\n// Only flush stdout in debug builds by default\nGLOBAL_DEF_RST(\"application/run/flush_stdout_on_print\", false);\nGLOBAL_DEF_RST(\"application/run/flush_stdout_on_print.debug\", true);\n```\n\nActually you know what... I almost got blinded by the forest instead of focusing on the tree. \n\nThe print_rich() not only handles the buffer differently but also correctly handles special characters and I bet we can resolve this with a wrapper to handle the device_id for the normal print call. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847646280/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847985057","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2847985057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2847985057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pwM2h","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T19:47:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T19:47:50Z","body":"@AThousandShips you should see that my PR isn't necessarily a bug fix but likely classified as an improvement to editor output window behavior to use the appropriate function based on the stringify results. This reduces the need to explicitly know which print call to use and allows print(value) -> print_rich(value) redirection if needed. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847985057/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848079253","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2848079253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2848079253,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pwj2V","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T20:38:35Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T20:38:35Z","body":"> The issue persists only on Windows machine (on Mac machine it is fine)\n\nAs a follow up note:\nIf the intended behavior is to be able to use function returns in raw format for print calls the OS.get_unique_id() result would be parsed differently due to a mac IOKit likely returning something like 00000000-0000-1000-8000-010203040506\n\nThe clue provided by the OP that the print call worked on MAC yet windows presented with curly brackets (and that seemed out of place) helped me derive the improvement. This will handle pretty much any print call where a function is passed that may need to be redirected to rich_print() instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848079253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848206684","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2848206684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2848206684,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pxC9c","user":{"login":"hex010","id":73882199,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODgyMTk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73882199?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010","html_url":"https://github.com/hex010","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T22:16:15Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T22:16:15Z","body":"I appreciate that you improved `print()`, but what about the trailing hidden character returned by `OS.get_unique_id()`?  Could that be fixed as well so I don't have to manually validate it on the server?\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03ee8a18-29c4-4763-9d46-14ef1b836c5c)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43249bf5-272d-4e11-a9b4-91841f78235c)\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848206684/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848212044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2848212044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2848212044,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pxERM","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T22:21:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T22:22:13Z","body":"> I appreciate that you improved `print()`, but what about the trailing hidden character returned by `OS.get_unique_id()`? Could that be fixed as well so I don't have to manually validate it on the server?\n> \n> ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03ee8a18-29c4-4763-9d46-14ef1b836c5c) ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43249bf5-272d-4e11-a9b4-91841f78235c)\n\nI closed my PR.... After more digging I realized that my approach was actually trying to handle a regression. I'll open a new PR once I can hunt down what change caused this. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1598d5fd-c891-461c-b283-c0878b4dc1c2)\n\n@AThousandShips Please tag this as a bug + regression","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848212044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848459156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2848459156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2848459156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pyAmU","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-03T06:14:18Z","updated_at":"2025-05-03T09:59:05Z","body":"Notes:\nIn Godot 4.4, curly braces were treated as regular characters with no special meaning in the console output system.\n\nIn the master branch, the introduction of rich text formatting capabilities means that curly braces {} are now treated as potential formatting markers, similar to how they're used in many string formatting systems. This is likely causing the text processing to enter an invalid state awaiting a valid formatting directive.\n\nUpdate:\nUpon further investigation there are quite a bit of handlers in place to protect the editor output which is a great thing ... I leaned into the discrepancy of the GUID length reported by the OP and found that the Windows API appears to be passing a null termination or character not covered by these protections. This introduces the extra character length and hangs the editor output.\nThe PR below will directly address that.  ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848459156/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848710210","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2848710210","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2848710210,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6py95C","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-03T16:53:18Z","updated_at":"2025-05-03T16:53:18Z","body":"@hex010 ☝ you should see this PR resolves your issue 👍 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848710210/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848727925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106012#issuecomment-2848727925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106012","id":2848727925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pzCN1","user":{"login":"hex010","id":73882199,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODgyMTk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73882199?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010","html_url":"https://github.com/hex010","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hex010/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-03T17:41:18Z","updated_at":"2025-05-03T17:41:18Z","body":"> [@hex010](https://github.com/hex010) ☝ you should see this PR resolves your issue 👍\n\nThank you for your work. I can confirm that it is resolved now👍","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848727925/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]